+# SRE Oncall Playbook — Aegis Platform (Staging & Production)
+
+Overview
+- This playbook contains the key operational steps for platform incidents, canary rollouts, and MTTR drills.
+
+Incident Triage
+- Check Prometheus for alerts: PlannerHallucinationRateHigh, CarbonIntensityHigh, IngestResumableErrorRateHigh, JobCarbonEmissionSpike.
+- Identify impacted services via Grafana dashboards.
+- If model promotion or inference is implicated, isolate by disabling promotion CI (flip GH Actions secret or disable pipeline).
+
+Canary rollout
+- Deploy model version to a single canary namespace/replica set.
+- Run smoke tests: functional inference, verifier checks, latency test.
+- Monitor SLI dashboard for 30 minutes; if green, continue to progressive rollout.
+
+MTTR Drill
+- Run services/agent/mttr_drill.py and verify rollback completes within mttr_target_s (ops/config/slo_definitions.json).
+- Record timestamped evidence in evidence bucket and file an incident report.
+
+Oncall Escalation
+- If SLO breach or critical incident, page the oncall via PagerDuty integration.
+- Follow incident response checklist: contain, mitigate, fix, recover, document.
+
+Postmortem
+- Runblameless postmortem, attach evidence artifacts from evidence bucket, update runbooks.
+
